## 🎨 DrawStep — How It Works

### 🆓 FREE

You open **DrawStep** and choose a photo from the app's built-in drawing library. You choose the drawing style you want, such as pencil, pen, crayon, paint, or charcoal. DrawStep then turns the selected image into a step-by-step drawing lesson. You can complete up to **3 lessons per day**.

### ⭐ ARTIST

With **Artist**, you get the same DrawStep experience, but you can access the **full photo library** and create **unlimited drawing lessons**. You can choose from all available drawing styles and follow each drawing progressively from the first construction lines through to the finished artwork.

### ✏️ ARTIST CUSTOM

With **Artist Custom**, you get everything included in Artist, but you can also **upload your own photos**. DrawStep analyzes your photo, creates a personalized drawing process for it, and guides you through the drawing step by step. You receive **5 custom-photo lessons per month**.

### 🔥 ARTIST CUSTOM PLUS

With **Artist Custom Plus**, you get everything in Artist Custom, but with **15 custom-photo lessons per month**. This is designed for people who regularly want to turn their own photos into personalized drawing lessons.

### 👑 ARTIST CUSTOM MAX

With **Artist Custom Max**, you get everything in Artist Custom Plus, but with **30 custom-photo lessons per month**. This is the highest plan for users who want to frequently upload their own photos and turn them into detailed, personalized drawing lessons.

### The basic experience

**Choose a photo → choose your medium → DrawStep creates the lesson → follow the stages → finish your drawing.** 🎨





